# Output directory for generated plots, logs and CSV/JSON exports.
#
# Kept in the repository via this file so the folder survives a fresh clone.
# Its contents are produced at runtime and are intentionally NOT committed:
#
#   fixedtime_simulation_results.png       fixed-time baseline curves
#   fixedtime_intersection_comparison.png  fixed-time per-junction ranking
#   mappo_training.png                     MAPPO training curves
#   mappo_comparison.png                   MAPPO per-junction ranking
#   sumo_errors.log                        SUMO diagnostics
#
# The dashboard also writes CSV/JSON session exports straight from the UI
# (exportCSV / exportJSON buttons in assiut_map.html) to wherever you save them.
